    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>护光者鲁伊亚</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3 · 三形态转场 + P3 峡谷之灵</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>P2（约 +80s）起<b>凶残痛击</b>全队重击 + 40 秒流血，P3 叠<b>光明之火</b>。最险轮预开<b>圣盾</b>，其余轮交<b>圣佑</b>或<b>保护</b>（无自律），期间用 1 分钟<b>牺牲</b>保脆皮。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="subhead">三形态转场轴（枭兽 → 熊形态 → 哈籁尼尔）</div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">P1 枭兽</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光明之火 · 守卫之怒</div><div class="s">6 秒点名光辉留沉默射线 · 4 码光明坠落</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span><span class="or">+</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">/</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给点名队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">协作断守卫之怒、躲 4 码圈；被点贴边放射线（想用圣佑接首发痛击需在开打 13 秒内交，否则留痛击），队友中光火给牺牲。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">P2 熊形态</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1240210}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">粉碎打击</div><div class="s">连发 3 波锥形冲击波（88.1 万 + 易伤 100%）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">看标记横移躲避 3 波</span></div>
            <div class="why">每 2 秒一道锥形（P3 幽灵熊同），吃中易伤再吃痛击必死，躲完 3 波再回背打。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">P2/P3</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241058}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>凶残痛击</div><div class="s">2 秒读条 · 全队 87.2 万物理 + 40 秒流血（回满才消）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span><span class="or">另一轮</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">/</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1022}}" alt="">保护祝福</span><span class="tgt">给自己或无自律队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条末预开<b>圣盾</b>免疫直击和流血（P3 叠光火可早 2–4 秒开）；其余轮交<b>圣佑</b>或<b>保护</b>免伤清流血（无自律队友同理）。救急用圣疗奶满清流血（注意 30 秒自律）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bars">
            <div class="bar-row"><span>不开减伤</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">87.2 万</span></div></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑 + 复仇盾</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:67%">58.6 万</span></div></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span>圣盾术（预开）</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫直击</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾免痛击，其余轮圣佑/保护</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">1 分钟牺牲保脆皮</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s7">下一段：蛤蟆区 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

